<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναυλος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without the flute,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμος -ότατος</span> a procession
				<i>unaccompanied by flutes,</i> i.e. <i>joyless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				791
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.406a
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναυλα ὀρχεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.277f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unmusical,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλη βοῶν ἄναυλα</span> (as Bgk. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναυδα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				699
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unskilled in flute-playing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
